# Cloudflare Pages — Cache headers
# El HTML y el SW siempre desde la red. Los assets estáticos pueden cachearse.

/
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /

/app.js
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate

/content.js
  Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
